{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>And you shall make their bars.</b> Rashi's comment: placed at thirds within the ten cubits of the plank's height, etc. The place for setting the bars in the planks, the place for placing three threads of sinew woven together like a sewn scroll of linen, and the place of the cities of refuge at the border of the land of Israel — the law of all three is equal."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:00:36.915483797Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}